window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c353-f5fa4a85ebae8ba8.json"]={sha256:"f5fa4a85ebae8ba8c5ac692c60d623432d3e1e61297002aae2539ceaf3ed45ef",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-4731afada99df59e","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/viking/","title":"Viking Mars landing program — NASA Science","titleEn":"Viking Mars landing program — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c353","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c353","related":[{"id":"c354","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-pathfinder/"],"title":"Mars Pathfinder 火星探路者","titleEn":"Mars Pathfinder","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：即使 z 超過教學門檻 3，也只標記需進一步機制驗證，不宣稱發現生命。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Even above the teaching threshold z=3, flag the result for mechanism testing rather than claim life. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"在輪速與影像位移之間建立滑移估計，不把馬達轉動當作實際行進。","differenceEn":"Estimate slip from wheel motion and image displacement instead of equating motor rotation with travel.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成樣本反應 12±2 單位，滅活對照 7±2 單位，兩個 ± 均為獨立 1σ。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²)。 結果約 1.76777 σ。獨立量測相減時方差相加；顯著差值只能排除指定零假設，不能唯一識別機制。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學小車輪半徑 0.065 m，轉 10 圈，影像量得前進 3.2 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10)。 結果約 0.216468 fraction。滑移率 s=1−實際距離/輪周理論距離；僅適用前進且理論距離非零的段落。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic sample response is 12±2 units and inactivated control 7±2 units; uncertainties are independent 1σ. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²). Result ≈ 1.76777 σ. Independent subtraction adds variances; a significant difference rejects a specified null, not every alternative mechanism.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. A model rover has 0.065 m wheel radius, ten revolutions and 3.2 m visual displacement. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: s=1−3.2/(2π×0.065×10). Result ≈ 0.216468 fraction. Slip s=1−actual travel/wheel-implied travel applies to forward segments with nonzero wheel travel.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c363","referenceUrls":["https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Rosetta"],"title":"Rosetta 彗星探測","titleEn":"Rosetta comet mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：即使 z 超過教學門檻 3，也只標記需進一步機制驗證，不宣稱發現生命。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Even above the teaching threshold z=3, flag the result for mechanism testing rather than claim life. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"用球對稱重力估算速度尺度，指出不能直接拿來設計真實近彗星軌道。","differenceEn":"Estimate a velocity scale with spherical gravity and explain why it cannot directly design a real near-comet orbit.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成樣本反應 12±2 單位，滅活對照 7±2 單位，兩個 ± 均為獨立 1σ。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²)。 結果約 1.76777 σ。獨立量測相減時方差相加；顯著差值只能排除指定零假設，不能唯一識別機制。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學引力參數 μ=650 m³/s²，距質心 r=3000 m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：ve=sqrt(2×650/3000)。 結果約 0.658281 m/s。球對稱近似逃逸速率 ve=sqrt(2μ/r)；忽略自轉、噴流、太陽潮汐與形狀。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic sample response is 12±2 units and inactivated control 7±2 units; uncertainties are independent 1σ. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: z=(12−7)/sqrt(2²+2²). Result ≈ 1.76777 σ. Independent subtraction adds variances; a significant difference rejects a specified null, not every alternative mechanism.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching gravitational parameter μ=650 m³/s² and center distance r=3000 m. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: ve=sqrt(2×650/3000). Result ≈ 0.658281 m/s. Spherical escape speed ve=sqrt(2μ/r) neglects rotation, jets, solar tides and shape.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-fb2d52756f35f162","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-pathfinder/","title":"Mars Pathfinder — NASA Science","titleEn":"Mars Pathfinder — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-bc9b892dc2094bff","url":"https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Rosetta","title":"ESA Rosetta","titleEn":"ESA Rosetta","publisher":"ESA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
